PUT /api/projects/{project_id}/managed_viewsets/{kind}/
Enable or disable a managed viewset by kind. PUT /api/environments/{team_id}/managed_viewsets/{kind}/ with body {"enabled": true/false}
Required: kind (path); project_id (path) — Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
